# Route & Controller Rules

## Routes
- One route file per resource (e.g. `task.routes.ts`).
- Routes only map paths to controller functions — no logic.
- Specific routes (e.g. `/tasks/by-priority`) before parameterized routes (`/tasks/:id`).

## Controllers
- Validation at the top using guard clauses.
- Error responses use `{ error: "message" }` format.
- Use 201 for creation, 204 for deletion.
- Always return early after sending a response.
- Controllers call services, never models directly.
